type: software
title: "Multi-fidelity Multi-point SBO"
abstract: >-
  A framework for surrogate-based optimisation (SBO) with asynchronous multi-point
  and/or multi-fidelity infill strategies, developed as part of the MSc thesis
  "Combining an Asynchronous Multi-Point and a Multi-Fidelity Infill Strategy for
  Surrogate-Based Optimisation" (Delft University of Technology, 2026).
authors:
